User Stories
earn xp
hamzah - As a student, I want to earn XP when I complete a course so that my progress feels rewarding.

Login and Register
Dwain - As a User, I want to register and login, so that I can have a personalised experience

View Dashboard
George - As a Student, I want to view a list of all available IBM SkillsBuild Courses so that I can be directed to and start new learning courses

Record Completion (Simulate Integration with IBM)
Rayn - As a Student, I want the app to record when I complete an IBM SkillsBuild Course so that I can view a history of my learning

Record Start Times
Vinay - As a Student, I want the app to record when I begin an IBM SkillsBuild Course so that I can pause and resume the courses

Search and Filter courses
Shamim - As a Student, I want to search and filter IBM SkillsBuild courses by keywords and categories so that I can quickly find courses relevant to my interests which would lead to improved efficiency and better time keeping.

sprint 2 user stories
earn badges
hamzah - As a student, I want to earn badges based on my XP so that I can visually see my progress and achievements.